{{!-- World Clock — the in-world time readout, with GM controls.

      Reads `worldClock` from the PARENT context rather than taking parameters. A
      partial still sees the parent's context for any name its parameters do not
      set, so passing the same object as a parameter buys nothing and invites the
      shadowing confusion that put two Roll Mode selects in the roll window.

      Owned by scripts/manager-worldclock.js and styles/worldclock.css. --}}
<div class="button worldclock-section{{#unless worldClock.isGM}} tool-readonly{{/unless}}{{#if worldClock.isNight}} is-night{{/if}}{{#unless worldClock.available}} is-unavailable{{/unless}}" data-tooltip="{{{worldClock.tooltip}}}" data-tool="worldclock-section">

    {{!-- Step controls render for the GM only. Time is the `core.time` WORLD
          setting, so a player pressing these would throw rather than quietly fail,
          and a control that errors is worse than one that is absent. --}}
    {{#if worldClock.isGM}}
    <i class="fa-solid fa-angles-left worldclock-step" data-direction="back" data-size="large" data-tooltip="Back {{worldClock.largeStepLabel}}"></i>
    <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-left worldclock-step" data-direction="back" data-size="small" data-tooltip="Back {{worldClock.smallStepLabel}}"></i>
    {{/if}}

    {{!-- The sky track. `--day-percent` positions the marker and is the only thing
          a repaint or a drag changes, so neither rebuilds markup. The gradient is
          fixed in CSS: it represents the shape of a day, which does not change,
          while the marker's position does. --}}
    <div class="worldclock-track" style="--day-percent: {{worldClock.dayPercent}}%">
        <i class="worldclock-marker {{worldClock.icon}}"></i>
    </div>

    <span class="worldclock-time">{{worldClock.timeText}}</span>

    {{#if worldClock.isGM}}
    <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right worldclock-step" data-direction="forward" data-size="small" data-tooltip="Forward {{worldClock.smallStepLabel}}"></i>
    <i class="fa-solid fa-angles-right worldclock-step" data-direction="forward" data-size="large" data-tooltip="Forward {{worldClock.largeStepLabel}}"></i>
    {{/if}}
</div>
